OL,3,GNEWSAFirm fined after worker crushed by
OL,4,Areversing truck
OL,5,
OL,6,FA company has been fined #28,000 after
OL,7,Fa worker suffered life-changing
OL,8,Finjuries when he was crushed by a
OL,9,Freversing truck.
OL,11,FSimon Pedder was conducting yard duties
OL,12,Fat Cotswold Vehicle Recovery in
OL,13,FHighworth, Wiltshire, when he was hit
OL,14,Fby a vehicle on 13 June 2025.
OL,16,FPedder, who now is a wheelchair user,
OL,17,Fsaid: "I can't fold the washing, I
OL,18,Fcan't go for a walk and I'm not allowed
OL,19,Fto drive. This accident took away my
OL,20,Ffreedom."
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
