OL,3,GNEWSAFirm fined after worker crushed by
OL,4,Areversing truck
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson from Cotswold Vehicle
OL,7,FRecovery, which was fined #28,000 at
OL,8,FBristol Magistrates' Court on Thursday,
OL,9,Fsaid it was "incredibly remorseful" and
OL,10,Fthat safety improvements had been made
OL,11,Fat the site.
